PAS实现依赖：(1) Compiler生成ordered commands时附带dependency信息和weight dimension（供analytical model使用）；(2) Analytical model需calibrate MU (systolic array 128×64, with column-tiling), DMA (weight loading BW from PIM), VU (16 VLIW, per-element latency), PIM (bank-level parallelism, per-GDDR6-command latency) 的执行时间模型；(3) Command scheduler的pending queue（256 command slots）和per-unit issue queues（4 slots each）tracking命令状态；(4) PCU的macro→micro解码表（每个macro command类型对应一个micro command sequence template）。PAS的mapping-aware scheduling在summarization阶段将QK^T和SV映射到MU时获得比PIM更高的performance（MU compute能力强），而在GPT-2 2.5B的larger head dimension (96)下将QK^T/SV映射到PIM省去K/V cache loading time→24% improvement。整体mapping-aware scheduling带来平均34%性能提升。类似概念：无完全相同的NPU-PIM统一内存调度方案已公开。

