## FC Mapping Algorithm for NPU-PIM Workload Distribution (FC层NPU-PIM映射算法)

术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
FC Mapping Algorithm（IANUS Algorithm 1）是IANUS在compile time决定每个FC层操作在MU（Matrix Unit, systolic array）还是PIM（Processing-in-Memory）上执行的启发式映射算法。核心思路：为有序命令序列中的每个MU_FC命令建立analytical execution time model——MU时间=L(weight loading time) + C(computation time)的pipelined估算（含column-tiling和VU prefetching overlap），PIM时间= input_token_count × per-token PIM execution time。选择estimated time更短的执行单元。若FFN的首FC映射到PIM，则GELU activation也链式分配到PIM（因IANUS PIM硬件支持FC后直接执行GELU via LUT，避免data round-trip）。

从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
```
Algorithm 1: FC Mapping for NPU-PIM
Input: CMDs (ordered commands with dependencies), T (MU tile size = 128)
Models: VU_model, MU_FC_model, DMA_weight_model, PIM_model

for i, cmd in enumerate(CMDs):
    if cmd.type != MU_FC:
        continue

    // Step 1: Check VU prefetching opportunity
    t_prefetch = 0
    if i > 0 and CMDs[i-1].type == VU:
        // VU execution overlaps with weight loading for next FC
        t_prefetch = VU_model(n, prev_cmd.dim)

    // Step 2: Model MU execution with column-tiling and pipelining
    w_cfg = cmd.weight_config  // {row, col}
    w_load = DMA_weight(w_cfg.row, T)       // Time to load one tile-column of weights
    mu_tile = MU_FC(n, w_cfg.row, T)        // Time to compute one tile-column
    mu_unpipe = mu_tile + w_load            // First tile: no overlap
    num_tiles = w_cfg.col / T                // Number of tile-columns
    mu_pipe = num_tiles * max(w_load, mu_tile)  // Pipeline: overlap load & compute
    mu_total = mu_unpipe + mu_pipe - t_prefetch

    // Step 3: Model PIM execution
    pim_time = n * PIM_model(w_cfg.row, w_cfg.col)
    // PIM_model accounts for: 
    //   - Bank activation (tRCD)
    //   - MAC cycles (= w_cfg.row / PU_width × w_cfg.col / banks_per_channel)
    //   - All-bank parallel: 16 banks × 8 channels = 128 concurrent MACs

    // Step 4: Select faster unit
    if pim_time < mu_total:
        cmd.type = PIM
        // Chain GELU if this is first FC of FFN
        if cmd.is_first_FC_of_FFN:
            CMDs[i+1].type = PIM  // GELU follows FC in PIM
```

具体数值示例（GPT-2 XL, embedding=1600, FC weight [1600×6400]）：
- n=1 (generation): MU_time ≈ 载入weight tile (6400/128=50 tiles × 加载128×128=~若干cycle) + compute, PIM_time = 1 × (128 banks并行处理) → PIM更快（省weight loading overhead）
- n=16: MU_time ≈ 同weight loading但并行处理16 tokens vs PIM_time = 16 × per-token → MU开始有利
- n=128 (summarization): MU_time中weight loading被大量computation摊销 → MU远快

Algorithm 1在4-16 input tokens范围内达94%准确率。平均1.4× speedup over always-PIM, 1.2× over always-MU。

术语一般如何实现？如何使用？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
实现需要：(1) 各execution unit的analytical model——MU model需考虑systolic array tile size (128), column-tiling overhead, pipelined weight loading与computation的max关系；PIM model需考虑per-token PIM latency（主要由GDDR6 activate+MAC cycles决定，与weight row/col成正比但与banks/channels数成反比）；DMA model需考虑weight loading bandwidth（256 GB/s external BW）；VU model需考虑per-element latency for layer norm / GELU。(2) Compiler需pre-scan ordered commands识别FC command和preceding VU command（prefetching opportunity）。(3) 如果PIM支持GELU activation（via LUT stored in reserved DRAM rows），则FFN的第一个FC映射到PIM时自动chain GELU到PIM，消除data round-trip。Algorithm 1的局限：仅考虑execution time，未考虑energy（MU energy > PIM energy for memory-bound ops），未考虑PIM capacity constraint（大模型时部分FC参数无法fit in PIM）。IANUS使用基于GDDR6-AiM的模型——PIM per-token latency = row_activations × tRC + MAC_cycles，其中row_activations与被处理weight matrix的row数相关（embedding dimension / 1024 elements per row）。

